          %h2#references References
          %p Early use of the terminology “pushout”:
          %ul
            %li#Mitchell65
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Barry+Mitchell"}> Barry Mitchell
              , Section I.7 of:
              = succeed "," do
                %em Theory of categories
              = succeed "," do
                %strong 17
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://www.elsevier.com/books/theory-of-categories/mitchell/978-0-12-499250-4"} ISBN:978-0-12-499250-4
          %p Early use of the terminology “amalgamated sums”:
          %ul
            %li#GabrielZisman67
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Pierre+Gabriel"}> Pierre Gabriel
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michel+Zisman"} Michel Zisman
